        "title": "Pick xTool model manually",
        "description": "Auto-discovery could not identify the device — discovered name `{name}`, firmware `{firmware}`.\n\nPick the model and firmware line from the list — pick the V2 entry if your firmware is recent (40.x range with the new communication framework), V1 otherwise.\n\nIf your model isn't listed, please [open an issue]({issue_url}) and include the discovered name and firmware so it can be added.",
